de IA","herramientas de IA vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''IA","outils d''IA vs concurrents","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternativen zu AI-Tools","AI-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von AI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que são agentes de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","alternativas para agentes de IA","agentes de IA vs outros","instalação de agentes de IA","guia de configuração de agentes de IA","desenvolvimento de soluções com agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ Агентов","альтернативы ИИ Агентам","ИИ Агенты vs другие","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","разработка решений с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لأدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل أخرى","تثبيت أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير حلول مع أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"hyperb1iss","repo":"hyperskills","repoPath":"hyperb1iss/hyperskills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:14:59.774Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai","description":"Use this skill when building AI features, integrating LLMs, implementing RAG, working with embeddings, deploying ML models, or doing data science. Activates on mentions of OpenAI, Anthropic, Claude, GPT, LLM, RAG, embeddings, vector database, Pinecone, Qdrant, LangChain, LlamaIndex, DSPy, MLflow, fine-tuning, LoRA, QLoRA, model deployment, ML pipeline, feature engineering, or machine learning.","bodyPreview":"# AI/ML Engineering\n\nBuild production AI systems with modern patterns and tools.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### The 2026 AI Stack\n\n| Layer               | Tool              | Purpose                          |\n| ------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Prompting           | DSPy              | Programmatic prompt optimization |\n| Orchestration       | LangGraph         | Stateful multi-agent workflows   |\n| RAG                 | LlamaIndex        | Document ingest","body":"# AI/ML Engineering\n\nBuild production AI systems with modern patterns and tools.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### The 2026 AI Stack\n\n| Layer               | Tool              | Purpose                          |\n| ------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Prompting           | DSPy              | Programmatic prompt optimization |\n| Orchestration       | LangGraph         | Stateful multi-agent workflows   |\n| RAG                 | LlamaIndex        | Document ingestion and retrieval |\n| Vectors             | Qdrant / Pinecone | Embedding storage and search     |\n| Evaluation          | RAGAS             | RAG quality metrics              |\n| Experiment Tracking | MLflow / W&B      | Logging, versioning, comparison  |\n| Serving             | BentoML / vLLM    | Model deployment                 |\n| Protocol            | MCP               | Tool and context integration     |\n\n### DSPy: Programmatic Prompting\n\n**Manual prompts are dead.** DSPy treats prompts as optimizable code:\n\n```python\nimport dspy\n\nclass QA(dspy.Signature):\n    \"\"\"Answer questions with short factoid answers.\"\"\"\n    question = dspy.InputField()\n    answer = dspy.OutputField(desc=\"1-5 words\")\n\n# Create module\nqa = dspy.Predict(QA)\n\n# Use it\nresult = qa(question=\"What is the capital of France?\")\nprint(result.answer)  # \"Paris\"\n```\n\n**Optimize with real data:**\n\n```python\nfrom dspy.teleprompt import BootstrapFewShot\n\noptimizer = BootstrapFewShot(metric=exact_match)\noptimized_qa = optimizer.compile(qa, trainset=train_data)\n```\n\n### RAG Architecture (Production)\n\n```\nQuery → Rewrite → Hybrid Retrieval → Rerank → Generate → Cite\n         │              │                │\n         v              v                v\n    Query expansion  Dense + BM25   Cross-encoder\n```\n\n**LlamaIndex + LangGraph Pattern:**\n\n```python\nfrom llama_index.core import VectorStoreIndex\nfrom langgraph.graph import StateGraph\n\n# Data layer (LlamaIndex)\nindex = VectorStoreIndex.from_documents(docs)\nquery_engine = index.as_query_engine()\n\n# Control layer (LangGraph)\ndef retrieve(state):\n    response = query_engine.query(state[\"question\"])\n    return {\"context\": response.response, \"sources\": response.source_nodes}\n\ngraph = StateGraph(State)\ngraph.add_node(\"retrieve\", retrieve)\ngraph.add_node(\"generate\", generate_answer)\ngraph.add_edge(\"retrieve\", \"generate\")\n```\n\n### MCP Integration\n\nModel Context Protocol is the standard for tool integration:\n\n```python\nfrom mcp import Server, Tool\n\nserver = Server(\"my-tools\")\n\n@server.tool()\nasync def search_docs(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search the knowledge base.\"\"\"\n    results = await vector_store.search(query)\n    return format_results(results)\n```\n\n### Embeddings (2026)\n\n| Model                  | Dimensions | Best For         |\n| ---------------------- | ---------- | ---------------- |\n| text-embedding-3-large | 3072       | General purpose  |\n| BGE-M3                 | 1024       | Multilingual RAG |\n| Qwen3-Embedding        | Flexible   | Custom domains   |\n\n### Fine-Tuning with LoRA/QLoRA\n\n```python\nfrom peft import LoraConfig, get_peft_model\n\nconfig = LoraConfig(\n    r=16,\n    lora_alpha=32,\n    target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"v_proj\"],\n    lora_dropout=0.05,\n)\n\nmodel = get_peft_model(base_model, config)\n# Train on ~24GB VRAM (QLoRA on RTX 4090)\n```\n\n### MLOps Pipeline\n\n```yaml\n# MLflow tracking\nmlflow.set_experiment(\"rag-v2\")\n\nwith mlflow.start_run():\n    mlflow.log_params({\"chunk_size\": 512, \"model\": \"gpt-4\"})\n    mlflow.log_metrics({\"faithfulness\": 0.92, \"relevance\": 0.88})\n    mlflow.log_artifact(\"prompts/qa.txt\")\n```\n\n### Evaluation with RAGAS\n\n```python\nfrom ragas import evaluate\nfrom ragas.metrics import faithfulness, answer_relevancy, context_precision\n\nresults = evaluate(\n    dataset,\n    metrics=[faithfulness, answer_relevancy, context_precision],\n)\nprint(results)  # {''faithfulness'': 0.92, ''answer_relevancy'': 0.88, ...}\n```\n\n### Vector Database Selection\n\n| DB       | Best For               | Pricing             |\n| -------- | ---------------------- | ------------------- |\n| Qdrant   | Self-hosted, filtering | 1GB free forever    |\n| Pinecone | Managed, zero-ops      | Free tier available |\n| Weaviate | Knowledge graphs       | 14-day trial        |\n| Milvus   | Billion-scale          | Self-hosted         |\n\n## Agents\n\n- **ai-engineer** - LLM integration, RAG, MCP, production AI\n- **mlops-engineer** - Model deployment, monitoring, pipelines\n- **data-scientist** - Analysis, modeling, experimentation\n- **ml-researcher** - Cutting-edge architectures, paper implementation\n- **cv-engineer** - Computer vision, VLMs, image processing\n\n## Deep Dives\n\n- [references/dspy-guide.md](references/dspy-guide.md)\n- [references/rag-patterns.md](references/rag-patterns.md)\n- [references/mcp-integration.md](references/mcp-integration.md)\n- [references/fine-tuning.md](references/fine-tuning.md)\n- [references/evaluation.md](references/evaluation.md)\n\n## Examples\n\n- [examples/rag-pipeline/](examples/rag-pipeline/)\n- [examples/mcp-server/](examples/mcp-server/)\n- [examples/dspy-optimization/](examples/dspy-optimization/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T06:57:01.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI/ML Engineering Agents requiring modern patterns and tools for building production AI systems.","zh":"适合需要现代模式和工具来构建生产AI系统的AI/ML工程代理。","ja":"モダンなパターンとツールを使用してプロダクションAIシステムを構築するために、AI/MLエンジニアリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"최신 패턴과 도구를 사용하여 프로덕션 AI 시스템을 구축하는 데 필요한 AI/ML 엔지니어링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de ingeniería de AI/ML que requieren patrones y herramientas modernas para construir sistemas de AI de producción.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''ingénierie AI/ML nécessitant des modèles et des outils modernes pour construire des systèmes de production AI.","de":"Ideal für AI/ML-Engineering-Agenten, die moderne Muster und Tools für den Bau von Produktions-AI-Systemen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de engenharia de IA/ML que exigem padrões e ferramentas modernas para construir sistemas de IA de produção.","ru":"Идеально для агентов инженерии ИИ/МЛ, требующих современных шаблонов и инструментов для построения систем ИИ промышленного уровня.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسيين للهندسة الاصطناعية / الماكين ليريكومينج التي تتطلب أنماطًا وأدوات حديثة لإنشاء أنظمة إنتاج اصطناعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready AI systems using programmatic prompt optimization with DSPy, stateful multi-agent workflows via LangGraph, and document ingest through LlamaIndex, leveraging the 2026 AI Stack for advanced AI/ML engineering capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理使用程序化的提示优化DSPy、状态多代理工作流LangGraph和文档摄取LlamaIndex，利用2026 AI栈来进行高级AI/ML工程能力的构建生产就绪AI系统。","ja":"DSPyを使用したプログラムによるプロンプトの最適化、LangGraphを使用したステートフルマルチエージェントワークフロー、LlamaIndexを使用したドキュメントの取り込みを活用し、2026 AIスタックを利用して、高度なAI/MLエンジニアリング機能を備えたプロダクションレディのAIシステムを構築することができます。","ko":"프로그램 방식의 프롬프트 최적화를 위한 DSPy, 상태 다중 에이전트 워크플로를 위한 LangGraph 및 문서 摂取을 위한 LlamaIndex를 사용하여, 2026 AI 스택을 활용하여 고급 AI/ML 엔지니어링 기능을 갖춘 프로덕션 준비 AI 시스템을 구축할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes construir sistemas de AI listos para la producción utilizando la optimización programática de instrucciones con DSPy, flujos de trabajo de multiagentes con estado a través de LangGraph y la ingesta de documentos a través de LlamaIndex, aprovechando la pila de AI de 2026 para capacidades de ingeniería de AI/ML avanzadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des systèmes de production AI prêts à l''emploi en utilisant l''optimisation programmatique des invites avec DSPy, les flux de travail d''agents multiples avec état via LangGraph et l''ingestion de documents via LlamaIndex, en exploitant la pile AI 2026 pour des capacités d''ingénierie AI/ML avancées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, produktionsbereite AI-Systeme zu erstellen, indem sie die programmatische Optimierung von Prompts mit DSPy, stateful Multi-Agent-Workflows über LangGraph und Dokumentenimport über LlamaIndex nutzen und auf die AI-Stack von 2026 für erweiterte AI/ML-Engineering-Funktionen zurückgreifen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir sistemas de IA prontos para produção usando otimização programática de prompts com DSPy, fluxos de trabalho de vários agentes com estado via LangGraph e ingestão de documentos por meio do LlamaIndex, aproveitando a Pilha de IA de 2026 para capacidades de engenharia de IA/ML avançadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать системы ИИ промышленного уровня с помощью программной оптимизации запросов с DSPy, потоков работ с несколькими агентами и состоянием через LangGraph, а также инжеста документов через LlamaIndex, используя Стек ИИ 2026 для продвинутых возможностей инженерии ИИ/МЛ.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء أنظمة إنتاج اصطناعية باستخدام تحسين البرنامج لتحفيز DSPy، و سير عمل متعدد الوكلاء الحالة من خلال LangGraph، و استهلاك المستندات من خلال LlamaIndex، و الاستفادة من رأس المال الاصطناعي 2026 لمهارات هندسة الاصطناعي / الماكين ليريكومينج المتقدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building production AI systems with modern patterns and tools","Optimizing prompts programmatically using DSPy","Orchestrating stateful multi-agent workflows with LangGraph"],"zh":["使用现代模式和工具构建生产AI系统","使用DSPy进行程序化的提示优化","使用LangGraph进行状态多代理工作流的编排"],"ja":["モダンなパターンとツールを使用してプロダクションAIシステムを構築する","DSPyを使用してプログラムによるプロンプトの最適化を行う","LangGraphを使用してステートフルマルチエージェントワークフローをオーケストレーションする"],"ko":["최신 패턴과 도구를 사용하여 프로덕션 AI 시스템을 구축하는 것","DSPy를 사용하여 프로그램 방식의 프롬프트 최적화를 수행하는 것","LangGraph를 사용하여 상태 다중 에이전트 워크플로를 오케스트레이션하는 것"],"es":["Construir sistemas de AI de producción con patrones y herramientas modernas","Optimizar instrucciones de forma programática utilizando DSPy","Orquestar flujos de trabajo de multiagentes con estado con LangGraph"],"fr":["Construire des systèmes de production AI avec des modèles et des outils modernes","Optimiser les invites de manière programmatique à l''aide de DSPy","Orchestrer les flux de travail d''agents multiples avec état avec LangGraph"],"de":["Produktions-AI-Systeme mit modernen Mustern und Tools erstellen","Prompts programmatisch mit DSPy optimieren","Stateful Multi-Agent-Workflows mit LangGraph orchestrieren"],"pt":["Construir sistemas de IA de produção com padrões e ferramentas modernas","Otimizar prompts programaticamente usando DSPy","Orquestrar fluxos de trabalho de vários agentes com estado com LangGraph"],"ru":["Построение систем ИИ промышленного уровня с современными шаблонами и инструментами","Программная оптимизация запросов с помощью DSPy","Оркестровка потоков работ с несколькими агентами и состоянием с LangGraph"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة إنتاج اصطناعية مع أنماط وأدوات حديثة","تحسين البرنامج للتحفيز باستخدام DSPy","أوركستر سير عمل متعدد الوكلاء الحالة مع LangGraph"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of AI/ML engineering principles","Dependent on the 2026 AI Stack layers and tools"],"zh":["需要AI/ML工程原理的知识","依赖于2026 AI栈的层和工具"],"ja":["AI/MLエンジニアリングの原則に関する知識が必要","2026 AIスタックの層とツールに依存している"],"ko":["AI/ML 엔지니어링 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요함","2026 AI 스택의 계층과 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de ingeniería de AI/ML","Dependiente de las capas y herramientas de la pila de AI de 2026"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en ingénierie AI/ML","Dépend des couches et des outils de la pile AI 2026"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der AI/ML-Engineering-Grundsätze","Abhängig von den Schichten und