INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('tadashi-aikawa/obsidian-another-quick-switcher/another-quick-switcher-release', 'another-quick-switcher-release', 'tadashi-aikawa', 'obsidian-another-quick-switcher', 'community', 'another-quick-switcher-release tadashi-aikawa obsidian-another-quick-switcher community obsidian plugin another-quick-switcher-release is an Obsidian plugin that provides an alternative quick switching experience. It benefits developers and users seeking efficient navigation within Obsidian. another-quick-switcher-release 是一个 Obsidian 插件，提供快速切换功能。通过 bun 和 gh 实现自动化的发布和验证 another-quick-switcher-release は、Obsidian プラグインであり、迅速な切り替え機能を提供します。bun と gh を使用して自動化された公開と検証を実現します another-quick-switcher-release는 Obsidian 플러그인으로 빠른 전환 기능을 제공합니다. bun과 gh를 사용하여 자동화된 배포 및 검증을 구현합니다 Another Quick Switcher Release es un plugin de Obsidian que ofrece una alternativa de conmutador rápido. Se ejecuta con bun y gh, y utiliza Codex para la generación de texto Another Quick Switcher Release est un plugin Obsidian qui propose une alternative de commutateur rapide. Il s''exécute avec bun et gh, et utilise Codex pour la génération de texte Another Quick Switcher Release ist ein Obsidian-Plugin, das eine Alternative zum Schnellumschalter bietet. Es wird mit bun und gh ausgeführt und verwendet Codex für die Texterzeugung O plugin Another Quick Switcher Release é uma escolha rápida para Obsidian, permitindo a execução de tarefas com eficiência. Плагин Another Quick Switcher Release - это быстрый выбор для Obsidian, позволяющий выполнять задачи эффективно с помощью ИИ Агентов إضافة Another Quick Switcher Release هي خيار سريع لبرنامج Obsidian، مما يسمح بتنفيذ المهام بفعالية باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use another-quick-switcher-release another-quick-switcher-release alternative another-quick-switcher-release install what is another-quick-switcher-release another-quick-switcher-release setup guide another-quick-switcher-release vs obsidian plugins obsidian plugin development bun and gh commands plugin release management Obsidian 插件 another-quick-switcher-release AI エージェント bun gh 自动化发布 快速切换 Codex CLI Utilizes bun for execution Leverages gh for authentication and repository management Executes scripts from the .agents/skills directory Supports escalated execution for sandbox and host environments Runs release.ts script for plugin release management Verifies gh auth status for secure authentication another-quick-switcher-release is an Obsidian plugin that enables quick switching functionality using bun and gh commands.');
