CLI مع Claude Code"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"context-loader: Setup Guide for AI Agents | AI Agent Skill","zh":"context-loader 设置指南：加载共享项目上下文","ja":"Context Loader AIエージェントのベストプラクティス","ko":"컨텍스트 로더 설정 가이드: 프로젝트 컨텍스트 로딩","es":"Guía de Configuración de Context Loader para Agentes de IA","fr":"Guide de Configuration de Context Loader pour Outils d''IA","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Context Loader in KI-Agents","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Context Loader: Carregando Contex...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка Context Loader для Загрузки Контекст...","ar":"إعداد معمل السياق: دليل لتحميل سياق المشروع"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to load shared project context with context-loader. Get started with our setup guide and ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.","zh":"了解如何使用 context-loader 加载共享项目上下文，确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","ja":"Context Loader AIエージェントを使用してプロジェクトコンテキストをロードし、Codex CLI と Claude Code の知識を同期します","ko":"컨텍스트 로더를 사용하여 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로딩하고 Codex CLI와 Claude Code의 지식을 동기화하는 방법을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a configurar Context Loader para cargar el contexto del proyecto en Codex CLI y mejorar la eficiencia del desarrollo","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer Context Loader pour charger le contexte du projet dans Codex CLI et améliorer l''efficacité du développement","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Context Loader einrichten, um den Projekt-Kontext in Codex CLI zu laden und die Entwicklungs-Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Context Loader para carregar contexto de projeto e garantir que o Codex CLI tenha o mesmo conhecimento que o Claude Code","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Context Loader для загрузки контекста проекта и обеспечить совместимость Codex CLI с Claude Code","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد معمل السياق لتحميل سياق المشروع وضمان توافق Codex CLI مع Claude Code"},"definition":{"en":"context-loader is a skill that loads shared project context from the .claude/ directory to ensure consistency between Codex CLI and Claude Code.","zh":"context-loader 是一种加载共享项目上下文的技能，用于确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","ja":"Context Loader は、共有プロジェクトコンテキストをロードするスキルです","ko":"컨텍스트 로더는 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로딩하는 기능입니다","es":"Context Loader es una habilidad que carga el contexto del proyecto para garantizar la consistencia en el desarrollo","fr":"Context Loader est une compétence qui charge le contexte du projet pour garantir la cohérence dans le développement","de":"Context Loader ist eine Fähigkeit, die den Projekt-Kontext lädt, um die Konsistenz in der Entwicklung zu gewährleisten","pt":"O Context Loader é uma habilidade que carrega contexto de projeto para garantir a compatibilidade entre o Codex CLI e o Claude Code","ru":"Context Loader - это навык, который загружает контекст проекта для обеспечения совместимости между Codex CLI и Claude Code","ar":"معمل السياق هو مهارة تقوم بتحميل سياق المشروع لضمان التوافق بين Codex CLI و Claude Code"},"features":{"en":["Loads coding rules from .claude/rules/ directory","Reads files such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md","Ensures Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code","Must run at the beginning of every task to load project context","Supports files in markdown format (.md)"],"zh":["从 `.claude/rules/` 目录加载编码规则","支持加载 coding-principles.md 和 dev-environment.md 文件","确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识","在每个任务开始时自动加载项目上下文","支持 `.claude/` 目录下的项目上下文加载"],"ja":["`.claude/rules/` ディレクトリからコーディングルールをロード","coding-principles.md と dev-environment.md ファイルのロードをサポート","Codex CLI と Claude Code の知識を同期","各タスクの開始時にプロジェクトコンテキストを自動的にロード","`.claude/` ディレクトリ下的プロジェクトコンテキストロードをサポート"],"ko":["`.claude/rules/` 디렉토리에서 코딩 규칙 로딩","coding-principles.md와 dev-environment.md 파일 로딩 지원","Codex CLI와 Claude Code의 지식을 동기화","각 태스크 시작 시 프로젝트 컨텍스트 자동 로딩","`.claude/` 디렉토리下的 프로젝트 컨텍스트 로딩 지원"],"es":["Carga de reglas de codificación desde `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilidad con Codex CLI","Garantiza la consistencia en el desarrollo","Lee archivos de configuración como `coding-principles.md` y `dev-environment.md`","Soporte para entornos de desarrollo como uv, ruff, ty y pytest"],"fr":["Chargement des règles de codage depuis `.claude/rules/`","Compatibilité avec Codex CLI","Garantit la cohérence dans le développement","Lit les fichiers de configuration tels que `coding-principles.md` et `dev-environment.md`","Prise en charge des environnements de développement tels que uv, ruff, ty et pytest"],"de":["Laden von Codierregeln aus `.claude/rules/`","Kompatibilität mit Codex CLI","Gewährleistet die Konsistenz in der Entwicklung","Liest Konfigurationsdateien wie `coding-principles.md` und `dev-environment.md`","Unterstützung für Entwicklungsumgebungen wie uv, ruff, ty und pytest"],"pt":["Carregamento de regras de codificação do diretório `.claude/rules/`","Leitura de arquivos de regras de codificação, como `coding-principles.md` e `dev-environment.md`","Compatibilidade com o Codex CLI e o Claude Code","Execução automática no início de cada tarefa","Suporte a diretórios personalizados para regras de codificação"],"ru":["Загрузка правил кодирования из директории `.claude/rules/`","Чтение файлов правил кодирования, таких как `coding-principles.md` и `dev-environment.md`","Совместимость с Codex CLI и Claude Code","Автоматический запуск в начале каждой задачи","Поддержка пользовательских директорий для правил кодирования"],"ar":["تحميل قواعد البرمجة من الدليل `.claude/rules/`","قراءة ملفات قواعد البرمجة، مثل `coding-principles.md` و `dev-environment.md`","التوافق مع Codex CLI و Claude Code","تشغيل تلقائي في بداية كل مهمة","دعم الدلائل المخصصة لقواعد البرمجة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use context-loader","context-loader setup guide","what is context-loader","context-loader alternative","context-loader vs claude code","install context-loader","context-loader for AI agents"],"zh":["context-loader","加载共享项目上下文","Codex CLI","Claude Code","`.claude/` 目录","加载编码规则","AI 工具","项目上下文加载"],"ja":["Context Loader","共有プロジェクトコンテキストのロード","Codex CLI","Claude Code","`.claude/` ディレクトリ","コーディングルールのロード","AIエージェント","プロジェクトコンテキストロード"],"ko":["컨텍스트 로더","공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트 로딩","Codex CLI","Claude Code","`.claude/` 디렉토리","코딩 규칙 로딩","AI 도구","프로젝트 컨텍스트 로딩"],"es":["Context Loader","Agentes de IA","Desarrollo de software","Codex CLI","Configuración de proyecto","Reglas de codificación","Entornos de desarrollo","Herramientas de desarrollo","Eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["Context Loader","Outils d''IA","Développement de logiciels","Codex CLI","Configuration de projet","Règles de codage","Environnements de développement","Outils de développement","Efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["Context Loader","KI-Agents","Software-Entwicklung","Codex CLI","Projekt-Konfiguration","Codierregeln","Entwicklungsumgebungen","Entwicklungs-Tools","Effizienz in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["context loader","carregamento de contexto","regras de codificação","codex cli","claude code","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","técnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["context loader","загрузка контекста","правила кодирования","codex cli","claude code","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","технологии разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["معمل السياق","تحميل السياق","قواعد البرمجة","codex cli","claude code","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تقنيات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki","repo":"claude-code-orchestra","repoPath":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T12:46:33.495Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"context-loader","description":"ALWAYS activate this skill at the start of every task. Load project context from .claude/ directory including coding rules, design decisions, and documentation before executing any task.","bodyPreview":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements","body":"# Context Loader Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nLoad shared project context from `.claude/` directory to ensure Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n**ALWAYS** - This skill must run at the beginning of every task to load project context.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Load Coding Rules\n\nRead all files in `.claude/rules/`:\n\n```\n.claude/rules/\n├── coding-principles.md   # Simplicity, single responsibility, early return\n├── dev-environment.md     # uv, ruff, ty, pytest requirements\n├── language.md            # Think in English, respond in Japanese\n├── security.md            # Secrets, validation, SQLi/XSS prevention\n├── testing.md             # TDD, AAA pattern, 80% coverage\n└── codex-delegation.md    # (skip - not relevant for Codex itself)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Load Design Documentation\n\nRead `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` for:\n- Architecture decisions\n- Implementation patterns\n- Library choices and constraints\n- TODO items and open questions\n\n### Step 3: Check Library Documentation\n\nIf the task involves specific libraries, read relevant files from:\n```\n.claude/docs/libraries/\n```\n\n### Step 4: Execute Task\n\nWith the loaded context, execute the requested task following:\n- Coding principles from rules\n- Design decisions from DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from docs\n\n## Key Rules to Remember\n\nAfter loading, always follow these principles:\n\n1. **Simplicity first** - Choose readable code over complex\n2. **Single responsibility** - One function/class does one thing\n3. **Type hints required** - All functions need annotations\n4. **Use uv** - Never use pip directly\n5. **Security** - No hardcoded secrets, validate input, parameterize SQL\n\n## Language Protocol\n\n- **Thinking/Reasoning**: English\n- **Code**: English (variables, functions, comments)\n- **User communication**: Japanese (when reporting back through Claude Code)\n\n## Output\n\nAfter loading context, briefly confirm:\n- Rules loaded\n- Design document status\n- Ready to execute task\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:55:46.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and Codex CLI requiring consistent project knowledge and context synchronization","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 Codex CLI 等 AI 代理，需要保持项目知识和上下文同步","ja":"Claude Code と Codex CLI などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらは一貫したプロジェクトの知識とコンテキストの同期を必要とします","ko":"Claude Code와 Codex CLI 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 일관된 프로젝트 지식과 컨텍스트 동기화를 요구합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y Codex CLI que requieren conocimiento y sincronización de contexto de proyecto consistentes","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et Codex CLI nécessitant des connaissances et une synchronisation de contexte de projet cohérentes","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und Codex CLI, die konsistentes Projektwissen und Kontextsynchronisierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e Codex CLI que requerem conhecimento de projeto consistente e sincronização de contexto","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Codex CLI, требующих последовательных знаний проекта и синхронизации контекста","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Codex CLI الذين يحتاجون إلى معرفة مشروع متسقة وتزامن السياق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to load shared project context from the .claude/ directory, ensuring consistent knowledge and adherence to coding rules defined in .claude/rules/ files, such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md","zh":"赋予代理从 .claude/ 目录加载共享的项目上下文，确保一致的知识和遵守 .claude/rules/ 文件中定义的编码规则，例如 coding-principles.md 和 dev-environment.md","ja":"エージェントが .claude/ ディレクトリから共有されたプロジェクトコンテキストを読み込むことを可能にし、coding-principles.md や dev-environment.md などの .claude/rules/ ファイルで定義されたコーディングルールに一貫した知識と遵守を保証します","ko":"에이전트가 .claude/ 디렉토리에서 공유된 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로드할 수 있도록 해주며, coding-principles.md 및 dev-environment.md와 같은 .claude/rules/ 파일에 정의된 코딩 규칙에 대한 일관된 지식과 준수를 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cargar el contexto de proyecto compartido desde el directorio .claude/, garantizando conocimiento y adherencia coherentes a las reglas de codificación definidas en archivos .claude/rules/, como coding-principles.md y dev-environment.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de charger le contexte de projet partagé à partir du répertoire .claude/, garantissant des connaissances et une adhésion cohérentes aux règles de codage définies dans les fichiers .claude/rules/, tels que coding-principles.md et dev-environment.md","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den gemeinsamen Projektkontext aus dem .claude/-Verzeichnis zu laden, wodurch konsistentes Wissen und Einhaltung der in .claude/rules/-Dateien definierten Codierregeln, wie z.B. coding-principles.md und dev-environment.md, gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a carregar contexto de projeto compartilhado do diretório .claude/, garantindo conhecimento consistente e aderência às regras de codificação definidas em arquivos .claude/rules/, como coding-principles.md e dev-environment.md","ru":"Позволяет агентам загружать общий контекст проекта из директории .claude/, обеспечивая последовательные знания и соблюдение правил кодирования, определенных в файлах .claude/rules/, таких как coding-principles.md и dev-environment.md","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحميل السياق المشترك للمشروع من الدليل .claude/، مما يضمن المعرفة المتسقة والامتثال لقواعد الترميز المحددة في ملفات .claude/rules/، مثل coding-principles.md و dev-environment.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Loading project-specific coding rules","Synchronizing knowledge between Codex CLI and Claude Code","Ensuring consistent development environment settings"],"zh":["加载项目特定的编码规则","在 Codex CLI 和 Claude Code 之间同步知识","确保一致的开发环境设置"],"ja":["プロジェクト固有のコーディング