INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra/context-loader', 'context-loader', 'DeL-TaiseiOzaki', 'claude-code-orchestra', 'community', 'context-loader DeL-TaiseiOzaki claude-code-orchestra community The context-loader skill loads shared project context from the .claude/ directory, ensuring Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code. This skill benefits developers by providing a consistent project context. context-loader 是一个加载共享项目上下文的技能，确保 Codex CLI 与 Claude Code 具有相同的知识。它从 `.claude/` 目录加载项目上下文 Context Loader は、共有プロジェクトコンテキストをロードし、Codex CLI と Claude Code の知識を同期するスキルです。`.claude/` ディレクトリからプロジェクトコンテキストをロードします 컨텍스트 로더는 공유 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로딩하여 Codex CLI와 Claude Code의 지식을 동기화하는 기능입니다. `.claude/` 디렉토리에서 프로젝트 컨텍스트를 로딩합니다 Context Loader carga el contexto del proyecto desde el directorio `.claude/` para garantizar que Codex CLI tenga los mismos conocimientos que Claude Code Context Loader charge le contexte du projet depuis le répertoire `.claude/` pour garantir que Codex CLI ait les mêmes connaissances que Claude Code Context Loader lädt den Projekt-Kontext aus dem Verzeichnis `.claude/`, um sicherzustellen, dass Codex CLI dieselben Kenntnisse wie Claude Code hat O Context Loader é uma habilidade que carrega contexto de projeto do diretório `.claude/` para garantir que o Codex CLI tenha o mesmo conhecimento que o Claude Code Context Loader - это навык, который загружает контекст проекта из директории `.claude/`, обеспечивая совместимость Codex CLI с Claude Code معمل السياق هو مهارة تقوم بتحميل سياق المشروع من الدليل `.claude/` لضمان توافق Codex CLI مع Claude Code how to use context-loader context-loader setup guide what is context-loader context-loader alternative context-loader vs claude code install context-loader context-loader for AI agents context-loader 加载共享项目上下文 Codex CLI Claude Code `.claude/` 目录 加载编码规则 AI 工具 项目上下文加载 Loads coding rules from .claude/rules/ directory Reads files such as coding-principles.md and dev-environment.md Ensures Codex CLI has the same knowledge as Claude Code Must run at the beginning of every task to load project context Supports files in markdown format (.md) context-loader is a skill that loads shared project context from the .claude/ directory to ensure consistency between Codex CLI and Claude Code.');
