INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('rockcodelabs/kw-app/kamal-deployment', 'kamal-deployment', 'rockcodelabs', 'kw-app', 'community', 'kamal-deployment rockcodelabs kw-app community kamal-deployment is an app for the Krakow alpine club that uses Kamal for zero-downtime deployments. It benefits developers by automating migrations and restarts. kamal-deployment是一款使用Kamal实现零宕机部署的工具，支持Docker和SSH Kamalを使用したゼロダウンタイムデプロイメントツールで、DockerとSSHをサポート Kamal을 사용한 무정지 배포 도구로 Docker와 SSH를 지원합니다 kamal-deployment es una aplicación para el club alpino de Krakow que utiliza Kamal para despliegues sin tiempo de inactividad en Raspberry Pi 4 y VPS kamal-deployment est une application pour le club alpin de Krakow qui utilise Kamal pour des déploiements sans interruption sur Raspberry Pi 4 et VPS kamal-deployment ist eine Anwendung für den Krakauer Alpenverein, die Kamal für Zero-Downtime-Deploiements auf Raspberry Pi 4 und VPS verwendet O Kamal Deployment é uma aplicação para clubes de montanhismo que utiliza Kamal para implantações sem downtime. Ele oferece recursos como restarts rolantes e migrações automatizadas. ИИ Агент Kamal Deployment - это приложение для альпийских клубов, использующее Kamal для установки без простоя. Он предлагает такие функции, как рулонные перезагрузки и автоматические миграции وكل Kamal Deployment هو تطبيق لأندية الجبال يستخدم Kamal لتنصيب بدون توقف. يقدم ميزات مثل إعادة تشغيل لولبي وتحويل آلي how to use kamal-deployment kamal-deployment setup guide kamal-deployment vs Capistrano zero-downtime deployment with Kamal Ruby deployment tools SSH-based deployment kamal-deployment install kamal-deployment alternative Kamal deployment tutorial kamal-deployment 零宕机部署 Kamal Docker SSH AI工具 Web应用部署 自动化部署 Rolling restarts using Kamal for zero-downtime deployments Automated migrations before deployment using Ruby Docker-based deployment for efficient containerization SSH-based remote execution for secure deployment Supports deployment to Raspberry Pi 4 (ARM64) and VPS (x86_64) environments kamal-deployment is a deployment tool that utilizes Kamal for zero-downtime deployments to staging and production environments.');
