ones web","Playwright","automatización de pruebas","depuración de aplicaciones web","testing de frontend","verificación de interfaz de usuario","herramientas de testing","pruebas de aplicaciones web con Playwright","guía de pruebas de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","Playwright","automatisation des tests","débogage d''applications web","testing de frontend","vérification de l''interface utilisateur","outils de test","tests d''applications web avec Playwright","guide de tests d''applications web"],"de":["Webanwendungstests","Playwright","Automatisierung von Tests","Fehlersuche bei Webanwendungen","Testing von Frontend","Überprüfung der Benutzeroberfläche","Testtools","Webanwendungstests mit Playwright","Anleitung zum Testen von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["webapp-testing","testes de aplicativos web","automação Playwright","testes de frontend","depuração de aplicativos web","captura de telas","inspeção de logs de console"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для Web Application Testing","тестирование веб-приложений","автоматизация Playwright","тестирование frontend","отладка веб-приложений","сделать скриншоты","осмотр логов браузера"],"ar":["webapp-testing","اختبار تطبيقات الويب","أتمتة Playwright","اختبار واجهة المستخدم","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب","التقاط لقطات الشاشة","فحص سجلات المتصفح"]}},"owner":"abeldotam","repo":"bmad-viewer","repoPath":"abeldotam/bmad-viewer","stars":6,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T17:51:49Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:52:25.388Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced web application testing capabilities with Playwright automation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Web应用程序测试功能的前端代理，使用Playwright自动化。","ja":"Playwright自動化を使用して高度なWebアプリケーションテスト機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"Playwright 자동화를 사용하여 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능을 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de prueba de aplicaciones web avanzadas con automatización de Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de test d''applications web avancées avec l''automatisation de Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Webanwendung-Testfunktionen mit Playwright-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de teste de aplicativos web com automação Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности тестирования веб-приложений с автоматизацией Playwright.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختبار تطبيقات الويب مع автоматизация Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate frontend functionality testing, verify UI behavior, and debug web application issues using real browser interactions and console log inspections, supporting protocols like HTTP and HTTPS, and file formats such as screenshots for documentation.","zh":"赋予代理自动化前端功能测试、验证UI行为、使用真实浏览器交互和控制台日志检查调试Web应用程序问题的能力，支持HTTP和HTTPS等协议，以及截图等文件格式用于文档记录。","ja":"エージェントに、Playwrightを使用してフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化し、UIの動作を検証し、リアルブラウザのインタラクションとコンソールログの検査を使用してWebアプリケーションの問題をデバッグする機能を提供する。また、HTTPおよびHTTPSなどのプロトコルや、ドキュメント化のためのスクリーンショットなどのファイル形式もサポートする。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하고 UI 동작을 검증하며 실제 브라우저 상호작용 및 콘솔 로그 검사로 웹 애플리케이션 문제를 디버깅할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 문서화에 대한 스크린샷과 같은 파일 형식도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la prueba de funcionalidad frontend, verificar el comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y depurar problemas de aplicaciones web mediante interacciones del navegador real y inspecciones del registro de la consola, admitiendo protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS, y formatos de archivo como capturas de pantalla para la documentación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend, de vérifier le comportement de l''interface utilisateur et de déboguer les problèmes d''applications web à l''aide d''interactions de navigateur réelles et d''inspections de journal de console, en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS, et des formats de fichiers tels que les captures d''écran pour la documentation.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Frontend-Funktionalitäts-Tests zu automatisieren, das Benutzerverhalten zu überprüfen und Webanwendungsprobleme mithilfe echter Browser-Interaktionen und Konsolen-Log-Inspektionen zu debuggen, wobei Protokolle wie HTTP und HTTPS sowie Dateiformate wie Screenshots für die Dokumentation unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend, verificar o comportamento da UI e depurar problemas de aplicativos web usando interações de navegador real e inspeções de log de console, suportando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS, e formatos de arquivo como capturas de tela para documentação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend, проверять поведение UI и отлаживать проблемы веб-приложений с помощью реальных взаимодействий браузера и проверок консольных журналов, поддерживая протоколы seperti HTTP и HTTPS, и форматы файлов, такие как скриншоты для документации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على Automate اختبار وظيفة Frontend، و التحقق من سلوك واجهة المستخدم، و تصحيح الأخطاء في تطبيقات الويب باستخدام التفاعلات الحقيقية للمتصفح و عمليات فحص سجل النظام، مع دعم البروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS، و تنسيقات الملفات مثل لقطات الشاشة للتوثيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend functionality tests","Debugging UI behavior and interactions","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation"],"zh":["自动化前端功能测试","调试UI行为和交互","验证表单提交和用户流程","捕获截图用于文档记录"],"ja":["フロントエンドの機能テストを自動化する","UIの動作とインタラクションをデバッグする","フォームの送信とユーザーフローを検証する","ドキュメント化のためのスクリーンショットをキャプチャする"],"ko":["프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화합니다","UI 동작 및 상호작용을 디버깅합니다","폼 제출 및 사용자 흐름을 검증합니다","문서화에 대한 스크린샷을 캡처합니다"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de funcionalidad frontend","Depurar el comportamiento y las interacciones de la interfaz de usuario","Validar envíos de formularios y flujos de usuario","Capturar capturas de pantalla para la documentación"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité frontend","Déboguer le comportement et les interactions de l''interface utilisateur","Valider les soumissions de formulaires et les flux d''utilisateur","Capturer des captures d''écran pour la documentation"],"de":["Automatisieren von Frontend-Funktionalitäts-Tests","Debuggen des Benutzerverhaltens und der Interaktionen","Überprüfen von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen","Erfassen von Screenshots für die Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend","Depurar comportamento de UI e interações","Validar envios de formulário e fluxos de usuário","Capturar capturas de tela para documentação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend","Отлаживать поведение UI и взаимодействия","Проверять отправку форм и потоки пользователей","Сделать скриншоты для документации"],"ar":[" Automate اختبار وظيفة Frontend","تصحيح سلوك واجهة المستخدم و التفاعلات","التحقق من إرسال الاستمارات و تدفقات المستخدم","التقاط لقطات الشاشة للتوثيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright automation setup","Limited to local web application testing"],"zh":["需要Playwright自动化设置","仅限本地Web应用程序测试"],"ja":["Playwright自動化の設定が必要","ローカルWebアプリケーションのテストに限定される"],"ko":["Playwright 자동화 설정이 필요합니다","로컬 웹 애플리케이션 테스트에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de automatización de Playwright","Limitado a pruebas de aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''automatisation de Playwright","Limité aux tests d''applications web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Automatisierungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungstests"],"pt":["Requer configuração de automação Playwright","Limitado a testes de aplicativos web locais"],"ru":["Требует настройки автоматизации Playwright","Ограничен тестированием веб-приложений на локальном уровне"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تلقائي Playwright","محدود باختبار تطبيقات الويب المحلية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"31e301853c09c350e8a55e8e078a1f6e5873f3cdda6cd05a46ddd3d1f0ab6c61","qualityScore":51}');
