для Ruby on Rails","ar":"إعداد وتشغيل QA لروبي أون ريلز"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to test FLOW plugin locally with qa, an opinionated Claude process for Ruby on Rails. Learn how to nuke cache and switch to local source with ease.","zh":"了解如何使用QA功能测试FLOW插件，并探索Ruby on Rails Opinionated Claude Process的优势","ja":"FLOWプラグインのテスト方法とRuby on Rails Opinionated Claude Processの特徴を紹介","ko":"FLOW 플러그인의 테스트 방법과 Ruby on Rails Opinionated Claude Process의 장점을 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a configurar y utilizar la herramienta de QA en Ruby on Rails para optimizar tus pruebas y desarrollo","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer et utiliser l''outil de QA pour Ruby on Rails pour optimiser vos tests et développement","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das QA-Tool in Ruby on Rails konfigurieren und verwenden, um Ihre Tests und Entwicklung zu optimieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o QA para Ruby on Rails e melhore a qualidade do seu código com nosso guia passo a passo","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить QA для Ruby on Rails и улучшить качество вашего кода с нашей пошаговой инструкцией","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد وتشغيل QA لروبي أون ريلز وتحسين جودة كودك بفضل دليلنا خطوة بخطوة"},"definition":{"en":"qa is an opinionated Claude process for Ruby on Rails that enables maintainers to test the FLOW plugin locally before releasing.","zh":"QA是Ruby on Rails Opinionated Claude Process中的一个功能，用于测试FLOW插件","ja":"QAはRuby on Rails Opinionated Claude Processの中のFLOWプラグインをテストする機能","ko":"QA는 Ruby on Rails Opinionated Claude Process에서 FLOW 플러그인을 테스트하는 기능","es":"QA es una herramienta de pruebas para Ruby on Rails que permite a los desarrolladores probar y optimizar su código de manera local","fr":"QA est un outil de test pour Ruby on Rails qui permet aux développeurs de tester et d''optimiser leur code de manière locale","de":"QA ist ein Testtool für Ruby on Rails, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihren Code lokal zu testen und zu optimieren","pt":"O que é QA? É um processo de teste para Ruby on Rails que utiliza o plugin Claude","ru":"Что такое QA? Это процесс тестирования для Ruby on Rails, использующий плагин Claude","ar":"ما هو QA؟ هو عملية اختبار لروبي أون ريلز التي تستخدم البرنامج الإضافي كلود"},"features":{"en":["Shows dev mode status and prompts for next action via `/qa` command","Nukes cache and switches marketplace to local source with `/qa --start`","Restores production marketplace and removes `.dev-mode` marker with `/qa --stop`","Re-registers local source and refreshes cache with `/qa --restart`","Utilizes `.dev-mode` marker for seamless switching between environments"],"zh":["支持FLOW插件的本地测试","提供dev mode状态显示和下一步操作提示","可以通过--start、--stop、--restart参数控制测试流程","支持缓存清除和本地源码注册","可以创建.dev-mode标记文件","支持生产市场环境的恢复"],"ja":["FLOWプラグインのローカルテストをサポート","dev modeステータスの表示と次のアクションの提示","--start、--stop、--restartパラメータによるテストフローの制御","キャッシュのクリアとローカルソースの登録",".dev-modeマーカーファイルの作成","プロダクションマーケット環境の復元"],"ko":["FLOW 플러그인의 로컬 테스트 지원","dev mode 상태 표시와 다음 액션提示","--start、--stop、--restart 파라미터를 통한 테스트 흐름 제어","캐시 클리어와 로컬 소스 등록",".dev-mode 마커 파일 생성","프로덕션 마켓 환경의 복원"],"es":["Pruebas locales con `/qa`","Nueke de caché y conmutación a fuente local con `/qa --start`","Restauración de marketplace de producción con `/qa --stop`","Re-registro de fuente local y actualización de caché con `/qa --restart`"],"fr":["Tests locaux avec `/qa`","Nukage du cache et commutation à la source locale avec `/qa --start`","Restauration du marketplace de production avec `/qa --stop`","Re-enregistrement de la source locale et mise à jour du cache avec `/qa --restart`"],"de":["Lokale Tests mit `/qa`","Nuke-Cache und Umschaltung auf lokale Quelle mit `/qa --start`","Wiederherstellung des Produktionsmarketplace mit `/qa --stop`","Neuregistrierung der lokalen Quelle und Cache-Aktualisierung mit `/qa --restart`"],"pt":["Nuke cache e troca de marketplace para fonte local","Criação de marcador de modo de desenvolvimento","Reinicialização do cache e re-registro da fonte local","Compatibilidade com Ruby on Rails","Uso de CLI para execução de comandos","Suporte a modo de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Очистка кэша и переключение на локальный источник","Создание маркера режима разработки","Перезапуск кэша и повторная регистрация локального источника","Совместимость с Ruby on Rails","Использование CLI для выполнения команд","Поддержка режима разработки"],"ar":["مسح الذاكرة المؤقتة وتغيير السوق إلى مصدر محلي","إنشاء علامة وضع التطوير","إعادة تشغيل الذاكرة المؤقتة وإعادة التسجيل المصدر المحلي","التوافق مع روبي أون ريلز","استخدام CLI لتنفيذ الأوامر","دعم وضع التطوير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use qa","qa setup guide","qa alternative","qa vs ruby on rails testing","qa install","what is qa","qa ruby on rails","qa testing","qa local testing"],"zh":["QA功能","Ruby on Rails","FLOW插件","AIエージェント","dev mode","缓存清除","本地源码注册","测试流程","生产市场环境"],"ja":["QA機能","Ruby on Rails","FLOWプラグイン","AIエージェント","dev mode","キャッシュのクリア","ローカルソースの登録","テストフロー","プロダクションマーケット環境"],"ko":["QA 기능","Ruby on Rails","FLOW 플러그인","AI도구","dev mode","캐시 클리어","로컬 소스 등록","테스트 흐름","프로덕션 마켓 환경"],"es":["QA Ruby on Rails","pruebas locales Ruby on Rails","herramienta de QA para Ruby on Rails","optimización de código Ruby on Rails","desarrollo de software con QA","Ruby on Rails desarrollo"],"fr":["QA Ruby on Rails","tests locaux Ruby on Rails","outil de QA pour Ruby on Rails","optimisation de code Ruby on Rails","développement de logiciels avec QA","Ruby on Rails développement"],"de":["QA Ruby on Rails","Lokale Tests Ruby on Rails","QA-Tool für Ruby on Rails","Optimierung von Ruby on Rails-Code","Software-Entwicklung mit QA","Ruby on Rails-Entwicklung"],"pt":["QA Ruby on Rails","teste de plugin local","configuração do QA","desenvolvimento de software","Ruby on Rails tutorial","QA Claude","plugin de teste","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["QA Ruby on Rails","локальное тестирование плагина","настройка QA","разработка программного обеспечения","Ruby on Rails уроки","QA Claude","плагин для тестирования","разработка приложений"],"ar":["QA روبي أون ريلز","اختبار البرنامج الإضافي محليًا","إعداد وتشغيل QA","تطوير البرمجيات","دروس روبي أون ريلز","QA كلود","برنامج إضافي للاختبار","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"benkruger","repo":"flow","repoPath":"benkruger/flow","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T23:41:43Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"qa","description":"QA the FLOW plugin locally. Switch marketplace to local source, test in a live session, restore when done.","bodyPreview":"# FLOW QA\n\nTest the FLOW plugin locally before releasing. Maintainer-only — requires the plugin to be installed.\n\n## Usage\n\n```text\n/qa\n/qa --start\n/qa --stop\n/qa --restart\n```\n\n- `/qa` — show dev mode status, then prompt for next action\n- `/qa --start` — nuke cache, switch marketplace to local source, create `.dev-mode` marker\n- `/qa --stop` — nuke cache, restore production marketplace, remove `.dev-mode` marker\n- `/qa --restart` — nuke cache, re-register local source, refresh cache (must alrea","body":"# FLOW QA\n\nTest the FLOW plugin locally before releasing. Maintainer-only — requires the plugin to be installed.\n\n## Usage\n\n```text\n/qa\n/qa --start\n/qa --stop\n/qa --restart\n```\n\n- `/qa` — show dev mode status, then prompt for next action\n- `/qa --start` — nuke cache, switch marketplace to local source, create `.dev-mode` marker\n- `/qa --stop` — nuke cache, restore production marketplace, remove `.dev-mode` marker\n- `/qa --restart` — nuke cache, re-register local source, refresh cache (must already be in dev mode)\n\n## Flag: `--start`\n\n### Step 1 — Check dev mode\n\nUse the Read tool to check if `.flow-states/.dev-mode` exists.\n\nIf it exists, print \"Already in dev mode. Use `/qa --stop` to exit.\" and stop.\n\n### Step 2 — Nuke cache and switch to local source\n\nGet the project root from `git worktree list --porcelain` (first `worktree` line).\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nrm -rf ~/.claude/plugins/cache/flow-marketplace\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace add <project_root>\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace update flow-marketplace\n```\n\n### Step 3 — Create dev mode marker\n\nUse the Write tool to create `.flow-states/.dev-mode` with the content `active`.\n\n### Step 4 — Announce\n\nPrint inside a fenced code block:\n\n````markdown\n```text\n============================================\n  FLOW QA — DEV MODE ACTIVE\n============================================\n```\n````\n\nThen print:\n\n> Plugin cache now contains local source.\n>\n> Open a **new** Claude Code session in a target project to test.\n> Run `/qa --stop` when done.\n\n## Flag: `--restart`\n\n### Step 1 — Check dev mode\n\nUse the Read tool to check if `.flow-states/.dev-mode` exists.\n\nIf it does not exist, run the `--start` flow instead (skip to the `--start` section above).\n\n### Step 2 — Nuke cache and re-register local source\n\nGet the project root from `git worktree list --porcelain` (first `worktree` line).\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nrm -rf ~/.claude/plugins/cache/flow-marketplace\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace add <project_root>\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace update flow-marketplace\n```\n\n### Step 3 — Announce\n\nPrint inside a fenced code block:\n\n````markdown\n```text\n============================================\n  FLOW QA — Cache refreshed\n============================================\n```\n````\n\nThen print:\n\n> Plugin cache updated from local source.\n>\n> Open a **new** Claude Code session in a target project to test.\n\n## Flag: `--stop`\n\n### Step 1 — Check dev mode\n\nUse the Read tool to check if `.flow-states/.dev-mode` exists.\n\nIf it does not exist, print \"Not in dev mode. Nothing to stop.\" and stop.\n\n### Step 2 — Nuke cache and restore production marketplace\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nrm -rf ~/.claude/plugins/cache/flow-marketplace\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace add benkruger/flow\n```\n\nThen:\n\n```bash\nclaude plugin marketplace update flow-marketplace\n```\n\n### Step 3 — Remove dev mode marker\n\nUse Bash to remove the marker:\n\n```bash\nrm .flow-states/.dev-mode\n```\n\n### Step 4 — Report\n\nPrint inside a fenced code block:\n\n````markdown\n```text\n============================================\n  FLOW QA — Dev mode stopped\n============================================\n```\n````\n\n## No flag (bare `/qa`)\n\nCheck if `.flow-states/.dev-mode` exists using the Read tool.\n\nIf dev mode is **active**, print inside a fenced code block:\n\n````markdown\n```text\n============================================\n  FLOW QA — Dev mode: ACTIVE\n  Plugin cache is using local source.\n============================================\n```\n````\n\nThen use AskUserQuestion:\n\n> \"What would you like to do?\"\n>\n> - **Restart QA** — refresh cache from local source\n> - **Stop QA** — restore production marketplace\n\nThen invoke the chosen flag (`--restart` or `--stop`).\n\nIf dev mode is **not active**, print inside a fenced code block:\n\n````markdown\n```text\n============================================\n  FLOW QA — Dev mode: INACTIVE\n  Plugin cache is using production source.\n============================================\n```\n````\n\nThen use AskUserQuestion:\n\n> \"Start QA dev mode?\"\n>\n> - **Yes, start** — runs `/qa --start`\n> - **No, cancel** — stop\n\nThen invoke `--start` if chosen.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:53:34.997Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Ruby on Rails Agents needing seamless local testing and marketplace switching capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝本地测试和市场切换功能的Ruby on Rails代理。","ja":"Ruby on Railsエージェントがシームレスなローカルテストとマーケットプレイス切り替え機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"루비 온 레일즈 에이전트가 무결점의 로컬 테스트와 시장 전환 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Ruby on Rails que necesitan pruebas locales sin problemas y capacidades de conmutación de mercado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Ruby on Rails ayant besoin d''un test local sans problème et de capacités de commutation de marché.","de":"Perfekt für Ruby on Rails-Agenten, die eine nahtlose lokale Testung und Marktplatzumschaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Ruby on Rails que necessitam de testes locais sem interrupções e capacidades de alternância de marketplace.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Ruby on Rails, требующих бесшовного локального тестирования и возможностей переключения marketplace.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Ruby on Rails الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات محلية دون انقطاع وقدرات تبديل سوق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test the FLOW plugin locally before releasing, utilizing Ruby on Rails, and providing a seamless way to switch between production and local marketplaces using commands like `/qa --start` and `/qa --stop`.","zh":"赋予代理在发布前使用Ruby on Rails测试FLOW插件的能力，并提供一种在生产和本地市场之间切换的无缝方式，使用诸如`/qa --start`和`/qa --stop`的命令。","ja":"エージェントがRuby on Railsを使用してFLOWプラグインをローカルでテストし、`/qa --start`や`/qa --stop`などのコマンドを使用して、生産とローカルマーケットプレイス間をシームレスに切り替える方法を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 루비 온 레일즈를 사용하여 플로우 플러그인을 로컬에서 테스트하고 `/qa --start` 및 `/qa --stop`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 생산 및 로컬 마켓플레이스 간을 무결점으로 전환할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar el plugin FLOW localmente antes de lanzarlo, utilizando Ruby on Rails, y proporciona una forma sin problemas de conmutar entre los mercados de producción y local utilizando comandos como `/qa --start` y `/qa --stop`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester le plugin FLOW localement avant de le publier, en utilisant Ruby on Rails, et fournit un moyen sans problème de basculer entre les marchés de production et locaux à l''aide de commandes comme `/qa --start` et `/qa --stop`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das FLOW-Plugin lokal zu testen, bevor es veröffentlicht wird, unter Verwendung von Ruby on Rails, und bietet eine nahtlose Möglichkeit, zwischen Produktions- und lokalen Märkten mit Befehlen wie `/qa --start` und `/qa --stop` zu wechseln.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar o plugin FLOW localmente antes de lançar, utilizando Ruby on Rails, e fornecendo uma forma sem interrupções de alternar entre marketplaces de produção e locais usando comandos como `/qa --start` e `/qa --stop`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать плагин FLOW локально перед выпуском, используя Ruby on Rails, и обеспечивает бесшовный способ переключаться между производственными и локальными рынками, используя команды, такие как `/qa --start` и `/qa --stop`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اختبار إضافة FLOW محليًا قبل الإصدار، مستخدمين Ruby on Rails، وتوفير وسيلة بدون انقطاع للتبديل بين أسواق الإنتاج والمحلية باستخدام أوامر مثل `/qa --start` و `/qa --stop`."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing FLOW plugin locally before release","Switching between production and local marketplaces","Debugging local marketplace issues"],"zh":["发布前本地测试FLOW插件","在生产和本地市场之间切换","调试本地市场问题"],"ja":["FLOWプラグインをローカルでテストする","生産とローカルマーケットプレイス間を切り替える","ローカルマーケットプレイスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["발매 전 로컬에서 플로우 플러그인 테스트","생산 및 로컬 마켓플레이스 간 전환","로컬 마켓플레이스 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Pruebas del plugin FLOW localmente antes de la versión","Conmutación entre los mercados de producción y local","Depuración de problemas del mercado local"],"fr":["Test du plugin FLOW localement avant la publication","Basculage entre les marchés de production et locaux","Débogage des problèmes de marché local"],"de":["Lokales Testen des FLOW-Plugins vor der Veröffentlichung","Umschalten zwischen Produktions- und lokalen Märkten","Fehlerbehebung bei lokalen Marktplatzproblemen"],"pt":["Testar o plugin FLOW localmente antes do lançamento","Alternar entre marketplaces de produção e locais","Depurar problemas de marketplace locais"],"ru":["Тестировать плагин FLOW локально перед выпуском","Переключаться между производственными и локальными рынками","Отлаживать проблемы локального рынка"],"ar":["اختبار إضافة FLOW محليًا قبل الإصدار","التبديل بين الأسواق الإنتاجية والمحلية","تصحيح أخطاء سوق محلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby on Rails","Maintainer-only access","FLOW plugin installation required"],"zh":["需要Ruby on Rails","仅限维护者访问","FLOW插件安装必需"],"ja":["Ruby on Railsが必要","メンテナのみにアクセス","FLOWプラグインのインストールが必要"],"ko":["루비 온 레일즈 필요","유지 관리자만 접근 가능","플로우 플러그인 설치 필요"],"es":["Requiere Ruby on Rails","Acceso solo para mantenedores","Se requiere la instalación del plugin FLOW"],"fr":["Nécessite Ruby on Rails","Accès réservé aux mainteneurs","L''installation du plugin FLOW est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby on Rails","Nur Zugriff für Maintainer","FLOW-Plugin-Installation erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige Ruby on Rails","Acesso apenas para mantenedores","Instalação do plugin FLOW necessária"],"ru":["Требует Ruby on Rails","Доступ только для сопровождающих","Требуется установка плагина FLOW"],"ar":["يتطلب Ruby on Rails","دخول صيانة فقط","تثبيت إضافة FLOW مطلوب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"aa524baf5c74f53541b14a05637a81e4f0c4dfae5a7cd73022f8eec8edb29893","qualityScore":51}');
