,"Données structurées JSON-LD (schema.org)","Création de fil d''ariane et d''URL canoniques","Compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS v4 et Vue 3"],"de":["Konfiguration der Website-URL und des Namens","Generierung von robots.txt und sitemap.xml","Dynamische Generierung von OG-Bildern","Strukturierte Daten im JSON-LD-Format (schema.org)","Erstellung von Brotkrumen und kanonischen URLs","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS v4 und Vue 3"],"pt":["SEO configuration com site URL, name e indexability","Geração de robots.txt e sitemap.xml","Geração dinâmica de imagem OG","JSON-LD estruturado para schema.org","Breadcrumbs e URLs canônicas","Integração com Nuxt UI e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["SEO конфигурация с site URL, name и indexability","Генерация robots.txt и sitemap.xml","Динамическая генерация изображения OG","JSON-LD структурированный для schema.org","Breadcrumbs и канонические URLs","Интеграция с Nuxt UI и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["تكوين SEO مع موقع URL واسم ومؤشرات","генерация robots.txt و sitemap.xml","توليد صورة OG动态","JSON-LD منظم لschema.org","Breadcrumbs وروابط إلكترونية","التكامل مع Nuxt UI و Tailwind CSS"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use nuxt-seo","nuxt-seo setup guide","nuxt-seo alternative","nuxt-seo vs next-seo","nuxt-seo install","nuxt-seo configuration","nuxt.js seo module","seo configuration for nuxt","nuxt-seo for ai agents"],"zh":["Nuxt SEO","AIエージェント","SEO 配置","robots.txt 生成","sitemap.xml 生成","动态 OG 图像生成","JSON-LD 结构化数据","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["Nuxt SEO","AIエージェント","SEO 設定","robots.txt 生成","sitemap.xml 生成","動的な OG 画像の生成","JSON-LD 構造化データ","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["Nuxt SEO","AI 에이전트","SEO 설정","robots.txt 생성","sitemap.xml 생성","동적 OG 이미지 생성","JSON-LD 구조화된 데이터","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["nuxt-seo","optimización de motores de búsqueda","Nuxt.js","Tailwind CSS v4","Vue 3","configuración de sitio","generación de sitemap","imagen OG","datos estructurados","migas de pan"],"fr":["nuxt-seo","optimisation des moteurs de recherche","Nuxt.js","Tailwind CSS v4","Vue 3","configuration de site","génération de sitemap","image OG","données structurées","fil d''ariane"],"de":["nuxt-seo","Suchmaschinenoptimierung","Nuxt.js","Tailwind CSS v4","Vue 3","Website-Konfiguration","Sitemap-Generierung","OG-Bild","strukturierte Daten","Brotkrumen"],"pt":["Nuxt SEO","Ferramentas de IA","otimização para motores de busca","SEO configuration","JSON-LD","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS","Guia de configuração Nuxt SEO"],"ru":["Nuxt SEO","ИИ Агенты","Оптимизация для поисковых систем","SEO конфигурация","JSON-LD","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS","Настройка Nuxt SEO"],"ar":["Nuxt SEO","الأدوات الذكية","تحسين محركات البحث","تكوين SEO","JSON-LD","Nuxt UI","Tailwind CSS","دليل إعداد Nuxt SEO"]}},"owner":"mattycraig","repo":"nuxt-theme-builder","repoPath":"mattycraig/nuxt-theme-builder","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:25:57Z","topics":["color-palette","design-system","nuxt-ui","nuxt4","tailwindcss-v4","theme-builder","vue3"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-seo","description":"Nuxt SEO meta-module with robots, sitemap, og-image, schema-org. Use when configuring SEO, generating sitemaps, creating OG images, or adding structured data.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawla","body":"# Nuxt SEO\n\n```bash\nnpx nuxi module add @nuxtjs/seo\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\nWorking with:\n\n- SEO configuration (site URL, name, indexability)\n- Robots.txt and sitemap.xml generation\n- Dynamic OG image generation\n- JSON-LD structured data (schema.org)\n- Breadcrumbs and canonical URLs\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) - if configuring site URL, name, or SEO foundation\n- [ ] [references/crawlability.md](references/crawlability.md) - if setting up robots.txt or sitemap.xml\n- [ ] [references/og-image.md](references/og-image.md) - if generating dynamic OG images\n- [ ] [references/schema-org.md](references/schema-org.md) - if adding JSON-LD structured data\n- [ ] [references/utilities.md](references/utilities.md) - if working with breadcrumbs, canonical URLs, or link checking\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Site Config\n\nFoundation for all SEO modules. Configure `site` in `nuxt.config.ts`, access via `useSiteConfig()`. See [references/site-config.md](references/site-config.md) for full options.\n\n## Module Overview\n\n| Module            | Purpose         | Key API                       |\n| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| nuxt-site-config  | Shared config   | `useSiteConfig()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/robots    | robots.txt      | `useRobotsRule()`             |\n| @nuxtjs/sitemap   | sitemap.xml     | `defineSitemapEventHandler()` |\n| nuxt-og-image     | OG images       | `defineOgImage()`             |\n| nuxt-schema-org   | JSON-LD         | `useSchemaOrg()`              |\n| nuxt-seo-utils    | Meta utilities  | `useBreadcrumbItems()`        |\n| nuxt-link-checker | Link validation | Build-time checks             |\n\n## Nuxt Content v3\n\nUse `asSeoCollection()` for automatic sitemap, og-image, and schema-org from frontmatter:\n\n```ts\n// content.config.ts\nimport { defineCollection, defineContentConfig } from ''@nuxt/content''\nimport { asSeoCollection } from ''@nuxtjs/seo/content''\n\nexport default defineContentConfig({\n  collections: {\n    posts: defineCollection(asSeoCollection({ type: ''page'', source: ''posts/**'' }))\n  }\n})\n```\n\n**Important:** Load `@nuxtjs/seo` before `@nuxt/content` in modules array:\n\n```ts\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''@nuxtjs/seo'', ''@nuxt/content'']\n})\n```\n\nFrontmatter fields: `ogImage`, `sitemap`, `robots`, `schemaOrg`.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [nuxt-content](../nuxt-content/SKILL.md) - For MDC rendering with SEO frontmatter\n\n## Links\n\n- [Documentation](https://nuxtseo.com)\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/harlan-zw/nuxt-seo)\n\n## Token Efficiency\n\nMain skill: ~250 tokens. Each sub-file: ~400-600 tokens. Only load files relevant to current task.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:15:32.484Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing advanced SEO configuration and semantic palettes for Nuxt UI","zh":"非常适合需要高级SEO配置和语义调色板的Nuxt UI网页开发代理","ja":"Nuxt UIの高度なSEO設定とセマンティックパレットが必要なWeb開発エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 SEO 구성 및 의미적 색상표가 필요한 Nuxt UI 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan configuración avanzada de SEO y paletas semánticas para Nuxt UI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web ayant besoin d''une configuration SEO avancée et de palettes sémantiques pour Nuxt UI","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte SEO-Konfiguration und semantische Paletten für Nuxt UI benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de configuração avançada de SEO e paletas semânticas para Nuxt UI","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходима продвинутая настройка SEO и семантические палитры для Nuxt UI","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى إعداد متقدم لتحسين محركات البحث واستخدام لوحات-semantics ل Nuxt UI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure SEO settings, generate robots.txt and sitemap.xml files, and create dynamic OG images using JSON-LD structured data and schema.org protocols, all within the Nuxt ecosystem","zh":"赋予代理配置SEO设置、生成robots.txt和sitemap.xml文件、使用JSON-LD结构化数据和schema.org协议在Nuxt生态系统中创建动态OG图像的能力","ja":"エージェントがSEO設定を構成し、robots.txtとsitemap.xmlファイルを生成し、JSON-LD構造化データとschema.orgプロトコルを使用してNuxtエコシステム内で動的OG画像を作成する能力を提供","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 설정을 구성하고 robots.txt 및 sitemap.xml 파일을 생성하며 JSON-LD 구조화 데이터 및 schema.org 프로토콜을 사용하여 Nuxt 생태계 내에서 동적 OG 이미지를 생성할 수 있는 능력","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar la configuración de SEO, generar archivos robots.txt y sitemap.xml, y crear imágenes OG dinámicas utilizando datos estructurados JSON-LD y protocolos schema.org, todo dentro del ecosistema Nuxt","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer les paramètres SEO, de générer des fichiers robots.txt et sitemap.xml, et de créer des images OG dynamiques à l''aide de données structurées JSON-LD et de protocoles schema.org, le tout dans l''écosystème Nuxt","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, SEO-Einstellungen zu konfigurieren, robots.txt- und sitemap.xml-Dateien zu generieren und dynamische OG-Bilder mit strukturierten JSON-LD-Daten und schema.org-Protokollen zu erstellen, alles innerhalb des Nuxt-Ökosystems","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar configurações de SEO, gerar arquivos robots.txt e sitemap.xml, e criar imagens dinâmicas OG usando dados estruturados JSON-LD e protocolos schema.org, tudo dentro do ecossistema Nuxt","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать настройки SEO, генерировать файлы robots.txt и sitemap.xml, и создавать динамические изображения OG с использованием структурированных данных JSON-LD и протоколов schema.org, все в рамках экосистемы Nuxt","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تكوين إعدادات تحسين محركات البحث، وإنشاء ملفات robots.txt و sitemap.xml، وإنشاء صور OG ديناميكية باستخدام البيانات المنظمة JSON-LD وبروتوكولات schema.org، كل ذلك داخل نظام Nuxt"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring site URL, name, and indexability for improved search engine rankings","Generating and managing breadcrumbs and canonical URLs for enhanced site navigation","Automating JSON-LD structured data integration for richer search engine results"],"zh":["为改善