 et GitHub","Création d''articles techniques avec 25-35 diagrammes PaperBanana","Utilisation de sources de recherche telles que des articles de recherche et de la documentation officielle","Mise en œuvre d''algorithmes de recherche avancés pour trouver des informations pertinentes","Génération de contenu technique détaillé et bien structuré"],"de":["Online-Suche nach hochwertigen Quellen wie arXiv und GitHub","Erstellung von technischen Artikeln mit 25-35 PaperBanana-Diagrammen","Verwendung von Forschungsquellen wie Forschungspapieren und offizieller Dokumentation","Implementierung von erweiterten Suchalgorithmen zur Suche nach relevanten Informationen","Generierung von detailliertem und gut strukturiertem technischem Inhalt"],"pt":["Pipeline automatizada para criar artigos técnicos","25-35 diagramas PaperBanana por artigo","Pesquisa em fontes de alta qualidade, incluindo arXiv e GitHub","Leitura profunda de fontes promissoras","Criação de artigos técnicos com base em pesquisa original"],"ru":["Автоматизированная pipeline для создания технических статей","25-35 диаграмм PaperBanana на статью","Поиск в высококачественных источниках, включая arXiv и GitHub, с использованием ИИ Агентов","Глубокое чтение перспективных источников","Создание технических статей на основе оригинальных исследований"],"ar":["خط أنابيب آلي لإنشاء مقالات تقنية","25-35 رسمًا PaperBanana لكل مقال","البحث في مصادر عالية الجودة، بما في ذلك arXiv و GitHub","قراءة متعمقة للمصادر الواعدة","إنشاء مقالات تقنية على أساس أبحاث أصلية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use research-topic","what is research-topic","research-topic alternative","research-topic vs Claude Code","research-topic install guide","research-topic setup for AI agents","automated technical blog post generation","PaperBanana diagram creation"],"zh":["AIエージェント","研究主题","技术博客文章","PaperBanana图表","Claude Code","自动化创建","原创研究论文","官方文档","GitHub实现"],"ja":["AIエージェント","研究トピック","技術ブログ記事","PaperBanana図","Claude Code","自動化作成","原著研究論文","公式ドキュメント","GitHub実装"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","연구 주제","기술 블로그 게시물","PaperBanana 다이어그램","Claude Code","자동화 생성","원본 연구 논문","공식 문서","GitHub 구현"],"es":["herramientas de investigación automatizada","creación de artículos técnicos","diagramas de PaperBanana","fuentes de alta calidad","arXiv","GitHub","investigación técnica","contenido técnico","automatización de la investigación"],"fr":["outils de recherche automatisés","création d''articles techniques","diagrammes PaperBanana","sources de haute qualité","arXiv","GitHub","recherche technique","contenu technique","automatisation de la recherche"],"de":["automatisierte Forschungstools","Erstellung von technischen Artikeln","PaperBanana-Diagramme","hochwertige Quellen","arXiv","GitHub","technische Forschung","technischer Inhalt","Forschungsautomatisierung"],"pt":["research-topic","artigos técnicos","diagramas PaperBanana","pipeline automatizada","pesquisa em fontes de alta qualidade","leitura profunda","criação de artigos técnicos","desenvolvimento de software","IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["исследование-тема","технические статьи","диаграммы PaperBanana","автоматизированная pipeline","поиск в высококачественных источниках","глубокое чтение","создание технических статей","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["برنامج research-topic","مقالات تقنية","رسومات PaperBanana","خط أنابيب آلي","البحث في مصادر عالية الجودة","قراءة متعمقة","إنشاء مقالات تقنية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"OmuNaman","repo":"blog-automation","repoPath":"OmuNaman/blog-automation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T15:25:34Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research-topic","description":"Deep research on a technical topic for blog writing. Use when user says research, look into, explore, or provides a blog topic to investigate. Searches the web extensively and creates structured research notes with visual opportunity identification.","bodyPreview":"# Deep Research Skill\n\n## Input\n$ARGUMENTS = the topic to research\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Broad Search (5 to 8 searches)\nSearch the web for high-quality sources on the topic:\n- Original research papers (arXiv, conference proceedings)\n- Official documentation and blog posts from the creators\n- Well-written technical blog posts (Lilian Weng, Jay Alammar, etc.)\n- Video transcripts or lecture notes if available\n- GitHub implementations for reference\n\n### Step 2: Deep Read\nFor each promising source","body":"# Deep Research Skill\n\n## Input\n$ARGUMENTS = the topic to research\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Broad Search (5 to 8 searches)\nSearch the web for high-quality sources on the topic:\n- Original research papers (arXiv, conference proceedings)\n- Official documentation and blog posts from the creators\n- Well-written technical blog posts (Lilian Weng, Jay Alammar, etc.)\n- Video transcripts or lecture notes if available\n- GitHub implementations for reference\n\n### Step 2: Deep Read\nFor each promising source, use WebFetch to read the full content.\nExtract and organize:\n\n**Core Concepts**\n- What is this? (one-paragraph definition)\n- Why does it exist? What problem does it solve?\n- What did it replace or improve upon?\n\n**How It Works (Technical Depth)**\n- Step-by-step mechanism\n- Key equations and their intuition\n- Concrete numerical examples (shapes, dimensions, values)\n- Implementation details\n\n**Comparisons and Alternatives**\n- How does this compare to previous approaches?\n- What are the trade-offs?\n- Quantitative comparisons (benchmarks, memory savings, speedups)\n\n**Historical Context**\n- When was it introduced? By whom?\n- What papers are most relevant?\n- How has it evolved since introduction?\n\n### Step 3: Identify Visual Opportunities\nThis is critical. For EVERY concept, ask: \"Would a diagram help here?\"\nList 6 to 10 concepts that NEED visual diagrams:\n- Architecture overviews\n- Data flow through components\n- Step-by-step process walkthroughs\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Matrix operations with concrete shapes\n- Mathematical derivation steps\n\nFor each, write:\n- Diagram name (e.g., \"fig_mla_architecture\")\n- What it should show\n- Type: architecture / flowchart / comparison / step-by-step / matrix-operation\n\n### Step 4: Save Research Notes\nSave to: `research/<topic-slug>.md`\n\nStructure:\n```\n# Research: <Topic Name>\n\n## Quick Summary\n(2-3 sentence overview)\n\n## Core Concepts\n(detailed notes)\n\n## How It Works\n(step-by-step technical breakdown)\n\n## Mathematical Foundation\n(key equations with explanations)\n\n## Comparisons and Alternatives\n(vs previous approaches, with numbers)\n\n## Visual Opportunities\n(list of 6-10 diagrams needed with descriptions)\n\n## Running Example\n(define the simple example we will use throughout:\n e.g., 4 tokens, specific dimensions, concrete values)\n\n## Key Sources\n- [Paper Name](url) - what we extracted from it\n- [Blog Post](url) - what we extracted from it\n```\n\n## Output\nSave to research/<topic-slug>.md and summarize key findings to user.\nTell the user how many diagram opportunities were identified.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:39:57.843Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Writing Agents needing in-depth research capabilities on specialized topics.","zh":"非常适合需要在专业话题上进行深入研究的技术写作代理","ja":"専門的なトピックに関する詳細な研究機能を必要とするテクニカルライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"전문적인 주제에 대한 심층적인 연구 능력을 필요로 하는 기술 작성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Técnica que necesitan capacidades de investigación en profundidad sobre temas especializados.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Écriture Technique ayant besoin de capacités de recherche approfondies sur des sujets spécialisés.","de":"Perfekt für Technische Schreibagenten, die umfassende Recherchefähigkeiten zu spezialisierten Themen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Técnica que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa aprofundada em tópicos especializados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов технического письма, которым необходимы глубокие исследовательские возможности по специализированным темам.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النصيين الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات بحث متعمقة في مواضيع متخصصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality, deeply pedagogical technical blog posts by leveraging automated pipelines, original research papers from arXiv, and official documentation, utilizing web searches and GitHub implementations for reference.","zh":"通过利用自动化管道、arXiv的原始研究论文和官方文档，并利用网页搜索和GitHub实现作为参考，赋予代理生成高质量、深入的教学技术博客文章的能力","ja":"自動化パイプライン、arXivのオリジナル研究論文、および公式ドキュメントを利用し、Web検索とGitHubの実装を参考として使用することで、高品質で深い教育的な技術ブログ記事を生成するエージェントの能力を付与する","ko":"자동화된 파이프라인, arXiv의 원본 연구 논문 및 공식 문서를 활용하고 웹 검색 및 GitHub 구현을 참조로 사용함으로써, 고품질의 깊은 교육적인 기술 블로그 게시물 생성 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar publicaciones de blog técnicas de alta calidad y profundamente pedagógicas mediante la utilización de pipelines automatizados, documentos de investigación originales de arXiv y documentación oficial, utilizando búsquedas web y implementaciones de GitHub para referencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des billets de blog techniques de haute qualité et profondément pédagogiques en exploitant des pipelines automatisés, des documents de recherche originaux d''arXiv et une documentation officielle, en utilisant des recherches web et des implémentations GitHub pour référence.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige, tiefgreifend pädagogische technische Blog-Beiträge zu generieren, indem sie automatisierte Pipelines, Original-Forschungspapiere von arXiv und offizielle Dokumentationen nutzen und Web-Suchen sowie GitHub-Implementierungen als Referenz verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar posts de blog técnicos de alta qualidade, profundamente pedagógicos, aproveitando pipelines automatizados, artigos de pesquisa originais do arXiv e documentação oficial, utilizando buscas na web e implementações do GitHub como referência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать технические блог-посты высокого качества, глубоко дидактические, используя автоматизированные конвейеры, оригинальные исследовательские статьи из arXiv и официальную документацию, используя веб-поиск и реализации GitHub в качестве справочного материала.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد منشورات مدونة تقنية عالية الجودة، ومتعمقة من الناحية التعليمية، من خلال استخدام خطوط أنابيب آلية، وأوراق بحث أصلية من arXiv، وتوثيق رسمي، مع استخدام عمليات البحث على الويب وتنفيذات GitHub كمرجع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating technical blog post generation","Researching niche topics with limited documentation","Creating comprehensive content analyses"],"zh":["自动化技术博客帖子生成","研究具有有限文档的专业话题","创建综合内容分析"],"ja":["技術ブログ記事の自動化生成","ドキュメントが限られているニッチなトピックの研究","包括的なコンテンツ分析の作成"],"ko":["기술 블로그 게시물 자동 생성","문서가 제한된 니치 주제 연구","포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de publicaciones de blog técnicas","Investigación de temas de nicho con documentación limitada","Creación de análisis de contenido comprehensivos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de billets de blog techniques","Recherche de sujets de niche avec une documentation limitée","Création d''analyses de contenu complètes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von technischen Blog-Beiträgen","Recherche von Nischenthemen mit begrenzter Dokumentation","Erstellung von umfassenden Inhaltsanalysen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de posts de blog técnicos","Pesquisar tópicos de nicho com documentação limitada","Criar análises de conteúdo abrangentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию технических блог-постов","Исследовать нишевые темы с ограниченной документацией","Создавать всесторонние контент-анализы"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء منشورات مدونة تقنية","البحث في مواضيع محددة مع توثيق محدود","إنشاء تحليلات محتوى شاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires web access for research","Dependent on quality of sources found","May need human oversight for accuracy and relevance"],"zh":["需要网页访问以进行研究","依赖于找到来源的质量","可能需要人类监督以确保准确性和相关性"],"ja":["研究を行うためにWebアクセスが必要","見つかった情報源の品質に依存している","精度と関連性を確保するために人間の監視が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["연구를 수행하기 위해 웹 액세스가 필요","발견된 정보원의 품질에 의존","정확성과 관련성을 보장하기 위해 인간의 감시가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso web para la investigación","Dependiente de la calidad de las fuentes encontradas","Puede necesitar supervisión humana para precisión y relevancia"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès web pour la recherche","Dépend de la qualité des sources trouvées","Peut nécessiter une surveillance humaine pour l''exactitude et la pertinence"],"de":["Benötigt Webzugang für die Recherche","Abhängig von der Qualität der gefundenen Quellen","Kann menschliche Überwachung für Genauigkeit und Relevanz benötigen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à web para pesquisa","Depende da qualidade das fontes encontradas","Pode precisar de supervisão humana para precisão e relevância"],"ru":["Требует доступа к интернету для исследования","Зависит от качества найденных источников","Может потребовать человеческого надзора для точности и актуальности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الويب للبحث","يعتمد على جودة المصادر المكتشفة","قد يحتاج إلى إشراف بشري من أجل الدقة والأهمية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"aaa4dc3f0d2e022c6ec72ec2e41eea70d62b6960f49cc28ee6fff5e3a9f19be7","qualityScore":51}');
